# KIPPER: the creatures' habits. A shellback stung by a torpedo hides in its
# shell, where plain torpedoes can't hurt it but ram torpedoes can; close by
# when it hides, it flings itself at the sub. A glimmer shows only against a
# wall. A riser shoots up at a sub above it; a billfish in front winds up and
# charges; a burr bristles when the sub comes close; a lanternmaw lunges; a
# sunstar flings itself; a snapworm warns, then strikes.
seed 1
game kipper
wait 5
cheat newgame
cheat clear
cheat calm
cheat god
cheat tile 70 28
wait 2
# a shellback a little way off
cheat foe 4 1060 470
wait 1
cheat hurtfoe 85 3
expect foe85_state == 1
expect foe85_hp == 11
cheat hurtfoe 85 3
expect foe85_hp == 11
cheat fit 0
cheat clear
# close by when it hides: it comes flying
cheat foe 4 1110 470
wait 1
cheat hurtfoe 85 3
wait 2
expect foe85_state == 2
cheat clear
# a glimmer: unseen until it touches a wall
cheat foe 2 1060 440
wait 1
expect foe85_state == 0
waituntil foe85_state > 0 300
cheat clear
# a riser under the sub shoots up
cheat foe 9 1128 500
wait 2
expect foe85_state == 1
cheat clear
# a billfish level with the sub, facing it: wind-up, then the charge
cheat foe 14 1060 456
wait 1
waituntil foe85_state == 2 120
cheat clear
# a burr bristles close by
cheat foe 15 1100 456
wait 2
expect foe85_state == 1
cheat clear
cheat foe 15 1060 456
wait 2
expect foe85_state == 0
cheat clear
# a lanternmaw lunges
cheat foe 8 1080 456
wait 2
expect foe85_state == 1
cheat clear
# a sunstar flings itself
cheat foe 13 1080 456
waituntil foe85_state == 1 60
cheat clear
# a snapworm: hidden, then a warning, then the strike
cheat foe 16 1100 456
wait 62
expect foe85_state == 1
waituntil foe85_state == 2 40
cheat clear
# a shellback walks to and fro along its floor and shoots at the sub
cheat tile 80 26
cheat clear
wait 2
cheat foe 4 1240 470
waituntil foe85_x < 1228 300
waituntil foe85_x > 1252 600
waituntil eshots_0 >= 1 400
expect eshot_vy100 < 0
